IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cat-domain`
IMPORT `cat-time`
IMPORT `cat-part1-preliminary`
IMPORT `cat-part2-div2-3-microchip-sterilise`
IMPORT `cat-part2-div4-5-transfer`
IMPORT `tests-fixtures`

-- TESTS — Part 2 Divisions 2-5 (ss 14-25) and regs 5, 17-19.

§ `Tests — microchipping, sterilisation, transfer`

§§ `A cat with certificates`

GIVEN dob    IS A DATE
      chipCert IS A BOOLEAN
      desexCert IS A BOOLEAN
      breeding IS A BOOLEAN
      keeper   IS A Person
GIVETH A Cat
`an entire unchipped cat born` dob `, chip certificate` chipCert `, desex certificate` desexCert `, for breeding` breeding `, kept by` keeper MEANS
    Cat WITH
        `name`                                     IS "Ziggy"
        `date of birth`                            IS dob
        `district where ordinarily kept`           IS "City of Perth"
        `kept in the State`                        IS TRUE
        `date of death`                            IS NOTHING
        `registration`                             IS NOTHING
        `registered with another local government since` IS FALSE
        `implanted device`                         IS NOTHING
        `sterilising procedure`                    IS NOTHING
        `certificate against microchipping`        IS IF chipCert  THEN JUST `a vet certificate` ELSE NOTHING
        `certificate against sterilisation`        IS IF desexCert THEN JUST `a vet certificate` ELSE NOTHING
        `keepings`                                 IS LIST `kept by` keeper `since` (YMD 2024 3 1)
        `name recorded as owner in a microchip database` IS NOTHING
        `custodian`                                IS NOTHING
        `foster placement`                         IS NOTHING
        `owned for the purpose of breeding`        IS breeding
        `sterilisation tattoo on the ear`          IS FALSE

`Fay` MEANS `a breeder named` "Fay" `, member of` EMPTY `, convicted` EMPTY `, noticed` EMPTY `, approved:` TRUE
`Gus` MEANS `a breeder named` "Gus" `, member of` EMPTY `, convicted` EMPTY `, noticed` EMPTY `, approved:` FALSE

§§ `s 14 — microchipping`

-- An adult cat, unchipped, no certificate: contravened.
#ASSERT     `s 14(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an entire unchipped cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, chip certificate` FALSE `, desex certificate` FALSE `, for breeding` FALSE `, kept by` `Alex`)
-- s 14(2): exempt with a veterinarian's certificate.
#ASSERT NOT `s 14(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an entire unchipped cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, chip certificate` TRUE  `, desex certificate` FALSE `, for breeding` FALSE `, kept by` `Alex`)
-- Under 6 months the duty has not arisen.
#ASSERT NOT `s 14(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an entire unchipped cat born` (YMD 2025 8 1) `, chip certificate` FALSE `, desex certificate` FALSE `, for breeding` FALSE `, kept by` `Alex`)
-- s 14(3): a certificate "cannot apply" to a cat under 6 months. Born 1 Aug
-- 2025, the cat reaches 6 months on 1 Feb 2026; on 31 Jan it is not exempt.
#ASSERT NOT `exempt from microchipping` (`an entire unchipped cat born` (YMD 2025 8 1) `, chip certificate` TRUE `, desex certificate` FALSE `, for breeding` FALSE `, kept by` `Alex`) `on` (YMD 2026 1 31)
#ASSERT     `exempt from microchipping` (`an entire unchipped cat born` (YMD 2025 8 1) `, chip certificate` TRUE `, desex certificate` FALSE `, for breeding` FALSE `, kept by` `Alex`) `on` (YMD 2026 2 1)
#ASSERT `s 14(1) — maximum fine` EQUALS 5000

§§ `s 15 — the implanter's 7-day notice`

-- Implanted Mon 1 Dec 2025: 7 days after end Mon 8 Dec.
#ASSERT NOT `s 15 is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 20) `as to` (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2025 12 1)) `, notice given on` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 8)) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `s 15 is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 20) `as to` (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2025 12 1)) `, notice given on` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 9)) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT NOT `s 15 is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 8)  `as to` (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2025 12 1)) `, notice given on` NOTHING `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `s 15 is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 9)  `as to` (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2025 12 1)) `, notice given on` NOTHING `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- reg 17 prescribes 13 items, (a) to (m).
#ASSERT count `reg 17 — information the implanter must give` EQUALS 13

#TRACE `s 15 — the implanter's duty, counted in days from the implantation` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the microchip implanter` DOES `give the microchip database company notice of the prescribed information` AT 9

§§ `s 16, s 17, reg 5`

#ASSERT     `s 16 is contravened, where the company` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 16 is contravened, where the company` TRUE
#ASSERT     `s 17 is contravened, where the person` TRUE `and the excuse is` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 17 is contravened, where the person` TRUE `and the excuse is` TRUE

`a non-complying device` MEANS
    `Implanted device` WITH
        `capable of being implanted in a cat` IS TRUE
        `designed to record information that can be electronically retrieved` IS TRUE
        `complies with AS 5018-2001` IS FALSE
        `complies with AS 5019-2001` IS TRUE
        `implanted by` IS `the vet`
        `date implanted` IS YMD 2025 12 1
#ASSERT     `reg 5(2) is contravened as to` `a non-complying device` `, where the person` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `reg 5(2) is contravened as to` (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2025 12 1)) `, where the person` TRUE
#ASSERT     `reg 5(3) is contravened by implanting` `a non-complying device`
#ASSERT NOT `reg 5(3) is contravened by implanting` (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2025 12 1))

§§ `s 18 — sterilisation`

#ASSERT     `s 18(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an entire unchipped cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, chip certificate` FALSE `, desex certificate` FALSE `, for breeding` FALSE `, kept by` `Alex`) `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`)
-- (2)(a) a veterinarian's certificate, the cat being over 6 months.
#ASSERT NOT `s 18(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an entire unchipped cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, chip certificate` FALSE `, desex certificate` TRUE  `, for breeding` FALSE `, kept by` `Alex`) `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`)
-- (2)(b) owned for breeding by an approved cat breeder.
#ASSERT NOT `s 18(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Fay` `as to` (`an entire unchipped cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, chip certificate` FALSE `, desex certificate` FALSE `, for breeding` TRUE `, kept by` `Fay`) `, its owners among` (LIST `Fay`)
-- ... but not by someone who breeds without approval,
#ASSERT     `s 18(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Gus` `as to` (`an entire unchipped cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, chip certificate` FALSE `, desex certificate` FALSE `, for breeding` TRUE `, kept by` `Gus`) `, its owners among` (LIST `Gus`)
-- ... and not where an approved breeder owns a cat that is not for breeding.
#ASSERT     `s 18(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Fay` `as to` (`an entire unchipped cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `, chip certificate` FALSE `, desex certificate` FALSE `, for breeding` FALSE `, kept by` `Fay`) `, its owners among` (LIST `Fay`)
-- (2)(c) no class is prescribed.
#ASSERT NOT `belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from sterilisation` `Alex's unregistered cat`
-- "sterilised by a veterinarian": a desexing by someone who is not one does
-- not discharge s 18(1).
`a cat desexed by a non-vet` MEANS
    `a Perth cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `kept by` (LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1)) `registered` NOTHING `chipped` NOTHING
        `desexed` (JUST (`Sterilising procedure` WITH `made permanently infertile by a surgical procedure` IS TRUE, `performed by a veterinarian` IS FALSE, `date performed` IS YMD 2024 3 1))
#ASSERT     `s 18(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` `a cat desexed by a non-vet` `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`)
#ASSERT NOT `s 18(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's unregistered cat` `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`)

§§ `s 19 — identifying a cat as sterilised (reg 18)`

#ASSERT     `s 19 is contravened by identifying` `the August kitten` `as sterilised by` `a sterilisation tattoo on the cat's ear`
#ASSERT     `s 19 is contravened by identifying` `the August kitten` `as sterilised by` `a sterilisation certificate given under section 21`
-- Not "in the manner prescribed": not this offence.
#ASSERT NOT `s 19 is contravened by identifying` `the August kitten` `as sterilised by` `some other means`
#ASSERT NOT `s 19 is contravened by identifying` `Alex's unregistered cat` `as sterilised by` `a sterilisation tattoo on the cat's ear`

§§ `s 20, s 21 — the veterinarian's duties`

-- Alex's cat (chipped) was desexed on 1 Mar 2024 — before the encoded period;
-- use a fresh desexing on Thu 18 Dec 2025: last day Mon 29 Dec 2025.
`a chipped cat desexed on 18 December 2025` MEANS
    `a Perth cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `kept by` (LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1)) `registered` NOTHING
        `chipped` (JUST (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2024 3 1)))
        `desexed` (JUST (`a desexing by a vet on` (YMD 2025 12 18)))
#ASSERT NOT `s 20 is contravened on` (YMD 2026 1 10) `as to` `a chipped cat desexed on 18 December 2025` `, notice given on` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 29)) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `s 20 is contravened on` (YMD 2026 1 10) `as to` `a chipped cat desexed on 18 December 2025` `, notice given on` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 30)) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- s 20 is about a MICROCHIPPED cat.
`an unchipped cat desexed on 18 December 2025` MEANS
    `a Perth cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `kept by` (LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1)) `registered` NOTHING `chipped` NOTHING
        `desexed` (JUST (`a desexing by a vet on` (YMD 2025 12 18)))
#ASSERT NOT `s 20 is contravened on` (YMD 2026 1 10) `as to` `an unchipped cat desexed on 18 December 2025` `, notice given on` NOTHING `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `s 21 is contravened, where the veterinarian` TRUE `, gave a certificate` FALSE `, and time has passed` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 21 is contravened, where the veterinarian` TRUE `, gave a certificate` TRUE  `, and time has passed` TRUE

§§ `s 23 — transfer`

GIVEN m        IS A DATE
      chipSat  IS A BOOLEAN
      desexSat IS A BOOLEAN
      breedSat IS A BOOLEAN
      voucher  IS A BOOLEAN
      to       IS A MAYBE Custodian
GIVETH A Transfer
`a transfer on` m `; satisfied of chip certificate` chipSat `, of desex certificate` desexSat `, of breeder` breedSat `; voucher` voucher `; to` to MEANS
    Transfer WITH
        `date of the transfer`                                  IS m
        `seller`                                                IS `Alex`
        `purchaser`                                             IS `Carl`
        `purchasing for the purpose of breeding`                IS breedSat
        `seller satisfied a microchipping certificate applies`  IS chipSat
        `seller satisfied a sterilisation certificate applies`  IS desexSat
        `seller satisfied the purchaser is an approved breeder buying to breed` IS breedSat
        `voucher for later sterilisation at no cost given`      IS voucher
        `transferred to`                                        IS to
        `transferred into foster care placed by`                IS NOTHING

`the plain transfer` MEANS `a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `; satisfied of chip certificate` FALSE `, of desex certificate` FALSE `, of breeder` FALSE `; voucher` FALSE `; to` NOTHING

-- (1): an unchipped cat, no certificate the seller is satisfied of.
#ASSERT     `s 23(1) is contravened by` `the plain transfer` `of` `the August kitten`
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(1) is contravened by` (`a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `; satisfied of chip certificate` TRUE `, of desex certificate` FALSE `, of breeder` FALSE `; voucher` FALSE `; to` NOTHING) `of` `the August kitten`
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(1) is contravened by` `the plain transfer` `of` `Alex's unregistered cat`
-- (2): an entire cat.
#ASSERT     `s 23(2) is contravened by` `the plain transfer` `of` `the August kitten`
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(2) is contravened by` (`a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `; satisfied of chip certificate` FALSE `, of desex certificate` TRUE  `, of breeder` FALSE `; voucher` FALSE `; to` NOTHING) `of` `the August kitten`   -- (a)(i)
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(2) is contravened by` (`a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `; satisfied of chip certificate` FALSE `, of desex certificate` FALSE `, of breeder` TRUE  `; voucher` FALSE `; to` NOTHING) `of` `the August kitten`   -- (a)(ii)
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(2) is contravened by` (`a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `; satisfied of chip certificate` FALSE `, of desex certificate` FALSE `, of breeder` FALSE `; voucher` TRUE  `; to` NOTHING) `of` `the August kitten`   -- (b) voucher
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(2) is contravened by` `the plain transfer` `of` `Alex's unregistered cat`
-- (3) and reg 19: to the RSPCA, or to a SAFE entity (reg 9(1)) — neither
-- subsection applies; to a private person they do.
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(1) is contravened by` (`a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `; satisfied of chip certificate` FALSE `, of desex certificate` FALSE `, of breeder` FALSE `; voucher` FALSE `; to` (JUST (`an organisation` `The Royal Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Animals, Western Australia`))) `of` `the August kitten`
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(2) is contravened by` (`a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `; satisfied of chip certificate` FALSE `, of desex certificate` FALSE `, of breeder` FALSE `; voucher` FALSE `; to` (JUST (`an organisation` `S.A.F.E. Hedland Inc`))) `of` `the August kitten`
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(2) is contravened by` (`a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `; satisfied of chip certificate` FALSE `, of desex certificate` FALSE `, of breeder` FALSE `; voucher` FALSE `; to` (JUST `a cat management facility`)) `of` `the August kitten`
#ASSERT     `s 23(2) is contravened by` (`a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `; satisfied of chip certificate` FALSE `, of desex certificate` FALSE `, of breeder` FALSE `; voucher` FALSE `; to` (JUST `a private person`)) `of` `the August kitten`
#ASSERT     `s 23(2) is contravened by` (`a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `; satisfied of chip certificate` FALSE `, of desex certificate` FALSE `, of breeder` FALSE `; voucher` FALSE `; to` (JUST (`an organisation` `another organisation`))) `of` `the August kitten`

§§ `s 24 — the seller's notices`

-- Transfer Thu 18 Dec 2025: last day Mon 29 Dec 2025 (holidays and weekend).
`a transfer on 18 December 2025` MEANS `a transfer on` (YMD 2025 12 18) `; satisfied of chip certificate` FALSE `, of desex certificate` FALSE `, of breeder` FALSE `; voucher` FALSE `; to` NOTHING
-- Registered AND microchipped: both notices are due.
#ASSERT NOT `s 24 is contravened, as at` (YMD 2026 1 10) `, by` `a transfer on 18 December 2025` `of` `Alex's registered cat` `, notices given on` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 29)) `and` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 29)) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `s 24 is contravened, as at` (YMD 2026 1 10) `, by` `a transfer on 18 December 2025` `of` `Alex's registered cat` `, notices given on` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 29)) `and` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 30)) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `s 24 is contravened, as at` (YMD 2026 1 10) `, by` `a transfer on 18 December 2025` `of` `Alex's registered cat` `, notices given on` NOTHING `and` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 22)) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- An unregistered cat: there is no local government "with which the cat is
-- registered", so only (b) is owed.
#ASSERT NOT `s 24 is contravened, as at` (YMD 2026 1 10) `, by` `a transfer on 18 December 2025` `of` `Alex's unregistered cat` `, notices given on` NOTHING `and` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 22)) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`

#TRACE `s 24 — the seller's duties, counted in days from the transfer` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the seller of the cat` DOES `give the local government notice of the purchaser and of other changes` AT 3
    PARTY `the seller of the cat` DOES `give the microchip database company notice of the purchaser and of other changes` AT 5

§§ `s 25 — the owner's notices of a change`

GIVEN day IS A DATE
      reg16 IS A BOOLEAN
      reg17 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Change to recorded information`
`a change on` day `, to register information` reg16 `, to database information` reg17 MEANS
    `Change to recorded information` WITH `date of the change` IS day, `changes reg 16 register information` IS reg16, `changes reg 17 database information` IS reg17

-- Alex moves house on Mon 1 Dec 2025: both reg 16(b) and reg 17(h) change.
-- Last day Mon 8 Dec 2025.
#ASSERT NOT `s 25 is contravened as to` `Alex's registered cat` `after` (`a change on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, to register information` TRUE `, to database information` TRUE) `by` `Alex` `, notices given on` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 8)) `and` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 8)) `, as at` (YMD 2025 12 20) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `s 25 is contravened as to` `Alex's registered cat` `after` (`a change on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, to register information` TRUE `, to database information` TRUE) `by` `Alex` `, notices given on` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 9)) `and` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 8)) `, as at` (YMD 2025 12 20) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- A change to database information only: the local government need not hear.
#ASSERT NOT `s 25 is contravened as to` `Alex's registered cat` `after` (`a change on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, to register information` FALSE `, to database information` TRUE) `by` `Alex` `, notices given on` NOTHING `and` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 8)) `, as at` (YMD 2025 12 20) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- Not the owner: not this person's duty.
#ASSERT NOT `s 25 is contravened as to` `Alex's registered cat` `after` (`a change on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, to register information` TRUE `, to database information` TRUE) `by` `Carl` `, notices given on` NOTHING `and` NOTHING `, as at` (YMD 2025 12 20) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
